spice
* Spice Netlist
V1 4 3 AC 1 ; AC voltage source at node 4 referenced to ground (node 3)
R1 4 2 1k ; Resistor R1 between nodes 4 and 2
Rf 2 2 10k ; Resistor Rf between node 2 and 2 (feedback)

* Op-Amp Model
* Assuming an ideal op-amp for simplicity
.subckt opamp 2 3 2
* Pins: 1 - Inverting input, 2- Non-inverting input, 3 - Output
.ends opamp

XOP 2 3 2 opamp ; Instantiating the op-amp subcircuit

.end